@startuml
title checkAndAdjustMachineReplaceCycleCountAndEffectiveCreationTimeout

start

:Read annotation state from MachineDeployment\n(effectiveCreationTimeout, effectiveCreationTimeoutLastAdjustedAt,\nreplaceCycleCount, replaceCycleCountLastAdjustedAt)\n**→ oldInfo**;

:windowStartMark = replaceCycleCountLastAdjustedAt\n(falls back to MCD creation timestamp if annotation absent);
:joinStartMark = now − 24 h;
:Scan all Machines → numJoinedInWindow, numFailedJoinInWindow,\nmaxJoinDuration (within 24 h lookback);

if (numJoinedInWindow > 0\nAND now − effectiveCreationTimeoutLastAdjustedAt\n> effectiveCreationTimeout?) then (yes)
  :effectiveCreationTimeout =\nmax(specTimeout, maxJoinDuration)\neffectiveCreationTimeoutLastAdjustedAt = now;
else (no)
  if (numFailedJoinInWindow > 0\nAND now − windowStartMark > effectiveCreationTimeout?) then (yes)
    :replaceCycleCount++\nreplaceCycleCountLastAdjustedAt = now;
    if (replaceCycleCount ≥ threshold?) then (yes)
      :effectiveCreationTimeout = min(current × growthFactor, 90 m)\neffectiveCreationTimeoutLastAdjustedAt = now\nreplaceCycleCount = 0;
    else (no)
    endif
  else (no)
  endif
endif

if (any annotation value changed?) then (yes)
  :Update MachineDeployment annotations\nvia API server;
endif

stop

@enduml
